    <othernotes>This is Rosie Richmond, one of the main characters in the original Fossil Fighters game.  She makes a cameo in the sequel game, Fossil Fighter Champions as the protagnoists' rival.  &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Background Knowlegde:  She's the granddaughter of Mr. Richmond, the founder of Vivosaur Island so she's very important and is said to be the champion of the island.  Throughout the game, she and the protagonist goes to different digsites and digs for fossils to revive them and use them as vivosaurs to battle.  This is called Fossil Battling.  Fossil Fighters like Rosie battle different people using 3 vivosaurs on a field.  The person to knock out all 3 of their opponent's vivosaurs is the winner.  Even though Rosie has been on many adventures, she doesn't have the best luck often getting into situations where the protagonist needs to save the day or save her.  Whether it's stolen things, a curse or being turned into a prehistoric criter, it's pretty rough for her but she's competitive and is ready to win.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lines to target:  For writers who want to target Rosie, these are the targets you can discuss.&lt;br&gt;Places she's gone (Digsites)-  She's gone to many digsites some in forests, islands, and volcanoes&lt;br&gt;Vivosaur Island- Her grandfather owns the island and she lives there.  Fossil Battles are very common&lt;br&gt;The Protagonists(original or Champions):  I have lore which makes sense for this.&lt;br&gt;BB Bandits- Bad guys that are obstacles in the game&lt;br&gt;Aliens/Dinaurians/Gunash- End game bad guys that are the main antagonists.&lt;br&gt;</othernotes>
